Sign-in checks that a phone is asking, not a script.

Settings › Appearance sets light or dark. A refused sign-in says why. Share-sheet tags wear their colours. Imports no longer stop at a skipped row, and Evernote code blocks import on their own lines. Links to Unbent open in the app. The account menu has Help and Support.

A shared web page becomes the note, pictures and all; a pasted one keeps its headings, links and lists.

A share your plan has no room for waits on the phone, and says why.
